nsional characters with  Netflix canceling it's Marvel shows who  knows the fate of a potential season  three I guess in that sense we're just  like Frank unsure of what's in store for  us in the future thanks for watching  everyone if you liked this video be sure  to give it a like and subscribe I've got  more videos in stores so make sure you  have that Belon if you have any  suggestions on what shows I should do  leave a comment below or shoot me a  message on Twitter  and remember daddy loves you very much
 

